  "description": "The prebuilt build tools of the CodeBrix.WebPlatform web application platform for macOS on Apple Silicon (ARM64) build machines: the Dioxus CLI (dx, built from a patched dioxus-cli) and the wasm-bindgen CLI, with their licence and third-party notices files - and, through the CodeBrix.WebPlatform.Styling.Tailwind4.MacOSArm64.MitLicenseForever package it depends on, the standalone Tailwind CSS program. Referencing the package copies them into the build program's output folder as frontend-tools/osx-arm64/ and tailwind/osx-arm64/, where CodeBrix.WebPlatform.FrontendBuilder finds them - nothing has to be compiled or installed. Choose the package of the machine the frontend is BUILT on.",
